    "pricing.faq.q1":          { zh: "与 ChatGPT / Perplexity 有什么不同？", en: "How is this different from ChatGPT / Perplexity?" },
    "pricing.faq.a1":          { zh: "它们答任何问题；研迹只答您的问题，且基于您的资料库。每次回答都附可点击的引用。",
                                  en: "They answer any question; ResearchTrace only answers yours, grounded in your library. Every answer comes with clickable citations." },
    "pricing.faq.q2":          { zh: "数据会被用于训练吗？", en: "Will my data be used for training?" },
    "pricing.faq.a2":          { zh: "不会。我们的合同条款包含 \"opt-out by default\"，您的资料库不进入任何公共训练集。",
                                  en: "No. Our contract is «opt-out by default» — your library never enters any public training set." },
    "pricing.faq.q3":          { zh: "可以离线 / 私有部署吗？", en: "Can it run offline / on-prem?" },
    "pricing.faq.a3":          { zh: "Team 方案以上支持自带 API key 与 VPC 部署，企业版支持 fully on-prem。",
                                  en: "Team and above support bring-your-own API keys and VPC deployment; Enterprise supports fully on-prem." },
    "pricing.faq.q4":          { zh: "我可以随时取消吗？",   en: "Can I cancel anytime?" },
    "pricing.faq.a4":          { zh: "随时。取消后保留只读访问 14 天，可随时导出全部数据。",
                                  en: "Anytime. After cancellation you keep read-only access for 14 days and can export everything." },
    "pricing.faq.q5":          { zh: "我现有的 Notion / Obsidian 笔记呢？", en: "What about my existing Notion / Obsidian notes?" },
    "pricing.faq.a5":          { zh: "支持双向同步。您不需要「迁移」，研迹与您现有工具共存。",
                                  en: "Two-way sync is supported. There's no «migration» — ResearchTrace coexists with your current tools." },
    "pricing.faq.q6":          { zh: "支持中文吗？",         en: "Does it support Chinese?" },
    "pricing.faq.a6":          { zh: "原生支持。中英双语 UI、双语简报、混合语料检索均经过专门优化。",
                                  en: "Natively. Bilingual UI, bilingual briefs, and mixed-corpus retrieval are all specifically optimized." },

