    "topic.ov.kicker":         { zh: "EDITOR&rsquo;S SYNTHESIS · 由 REPORTER AGENT 综述 · 5月8日 23:47",
                                  en: "EDITOR&rsquo;S SYNTHESIS · synthesized by REPORTER AGENT · May 8, 23:47" },
    "topic.ov.h1":             { zh: "长上下文之争：显式记忆压缩与端到端注意力扩展，分歧加剧。",
                                  en: "The long-context contest: explicit memory compression vs end-to-end attention scaling, divergence intensifies." },
    "topic.ov.brief.label":    { zh: "EDITOR&rsquo;S BRIEF · 30秒摘要", en: "EDITOR&rsquo;S BRIEF · 30s summary" },
    "topic.ov.brief.body.html":{ zh: "本主题在过去 30 天积累了 <strong>38 项关键论断</strong>、<strong>412 处证据</strong>。两条主流路线正在分化 —— <strong>路线 A（DeepMind/Anthropic 系）</strong>主张端到端扩展注意力上下文窗口；<strong>路线 B（Microsoft Research/MemGPT 系）</strong>主张以外部 episodic memory 替代长窗口。Curator 认为：两者并非互斥，更可能在 2026 年下半年走向\"双层混合\"架构。",
                                  en: "Over the past 30 days this topic gathered <strong>38 key claims</strong> and <strong>412 pieces of evidence</strong>. Two main routes are diverging — <strong>Route A (DeepMind/Anthropic camp)</strong> argues for end-to-end attention window scaling; <strong>Route B (Microsoft Research/MemGPT camp)</strong> argues for external episodic memory in place of long windows. Curator's view: they are not mutually exclusive — H2 2026 will most likely converge on a «two-tier hybrid» architecture." },
    "topic.ov.p1.html":        { zh: "过去三十天内，长上下文这一领域共有 <a href=\"topic.html?t=llm-longctx&tab=evidence\" class=\"link-red\">412 篇文献证据</a>被纳入您的资料库。其中最具影响的是 <strong>5月7日</strong> DeepMind 发布的 Recurrent Memory Transformer v3，它以循环压缩机制在 2,097,152 token 长度上保持线性复杂度<a class=\"cite\" href=\"ask.html?cite=rmt-v3\">1</a>。同期 Anthropic 公开了 Claude 3.5 在 200K 上下文上的 needle-in-haystack 评测，跨 12 类配置全部通过，准确率 99.4%<a class=\"cite\" href=\"ask.html?cite=claude-needle\">2</a>。",
                                  en: "Over the past 30 days, <a href=\"topic.html?t=llm-longctx&tab=evidence\" class=\"link-red\">412 pieces of literature evidence</a> entered your library on long context. The most impactful: on <strong>May 7</strong>, DeepMind released Recurrent Memory Transformer v3, holding linear complexity at 2,097,152 tokens via recurrent compression<a class=\"cite\" href=\"ask.html?cite=rmt-v3\">1</a>. The same week, Anthropic released Claude 3.5's needle-in-haystack at 200K — passing all 12 configurations at 99.4%<a class=\"cite\" href=\"ask.html?cite=claude-needle\">2</a>." },
    "topic.ov.p2.html":        { zh: "然而，您 4月17日 收藏的 <em>LongMem</em> 论文<a class=\"cite\" href=\"ask.html?cite=longmem\">3</a> 隐含的另一条道路 —— 即用外部记忆模块\"假装\"长上下文 —— 并未消亡。Microsoft Research 在 5月3日 提出的 GraphRAG v0.4 实验中显示<a class=\"cite\" href=\"ask.html?cite=graphrag\">4</a>，对 1M token 文档的 QA 任务，外部记忆 + 8K 窗口的组合在 17 项指标中 11 项优于纯 200K 上下文方案。这意味着两条路线在不同任务结构上各占胜场。",
                                  en: "Yet the alternative road implied by your <em>LongMem</em> save from Apr 17<a class=\"cite\" href=\"ask.html?cite=longmem\">3</a> — using an external memory module to «fake» long context — hasn't died. Microsoft Research's GraphRAG v0.4 experiment from May 3<a class=\"cite\" href=\"ask.html?cite=graphrag\">4</a> shows that on 1M-token document QA, external memory + 8K window beat pure 200K on 11 of 17 metrics. The two routes win different task structures." },
    "topic.ov.h3":             { zh: "三个您需要知道的分歧",            en: "Three disagreements you should know about" },
    "topic.ov.li1.html":       { zh: "<strong>压缩损失之争 ——</strong> RMT v3 论文称压缩损失 ≤ 2.3%，但 Anthropic 团队指出其测试集偏向\"叙事文本\"，在代码 / 表格类长上下文上损失会被低估<a class=\"cite\" href=\"ask.html?cite=anth-rebuttal\">5</a>。",
                                  en: "<strong>Compression-loss debate ——</strong> the RMT v3 paper claims ≤ 2.3% compression loss, but the Anthropic team points out the test set is biased toward narrative text, understating losses for code and tabular long-context<a class=\"cite\" href=\"ask.html?cite=anth-rebuttal\">5</a>." },
    "topic.ov.li2.html":       { zh: "<strong>定位检索之争 ——</strong> needle-in-haystack 是否仍是有效评测？HELM v3 团队认为单 needle 任务已过于简单，应转向 multi-needle + 反事实 needle<a class=\"cite\" href=\"ask.html?cite=helm-v3\">6</a>。",
                                  en: "<strong>Retrieval-eval debate ——</strong> is needle-in-haystack still valid? The HELM v3 team argues single-needle is too easy now — replace it with multi-needle + counterfactual needles<a class=\"cite\" href=\"ask.html?cite=helm-v3\">6</a>." },
    "topic.ov.li3.html":       { zh: "<strong>推理成本之争 ——</strong> 您 4月22日的笔记 <a href=\"ask.html?cite=note-2204\" class=\"link-red\">\"长窗口的真实成本\"</a>已指出：在生产系统中 200K 上下文的 KV cache 显存占用是 8K 的 25 倍，这一点尚未被任何头条工作正视。",
                                  en: "<strong>Inference-cost debate ——</strong> your note from Apr 22 <a href=\"ask.html?cite=note-2204\" class=\"link-red\">«The real cost of long windows»</a> already pointed out: in production, 200K-context KV cache memory is 25× that of 8K — and no headline work has confronted this yet." },
